low on her hips and bunch a little at the ankles. Her hair is pulled into a messy low ponytail at the nape of her neck, several loose strands escaping around her face, along her neck and over her left shoulder. Her eyes look straight into the front camera lens, eyelids a little lowered, and her lips stay closed in a small neutral expression with the corners barely lifted. Behind her the fluorescent tube lights of the aisle stretch into the distance, colorful cereal boxes and snack packages line both shelves in tight rows, a half-full shopping cart sits visible on the left side of the frame, and the floor is pale linoleum with faint scuff marks. Flat overhead supermarket lighting leaves the whole scene a little underexposed and cool-toned, soft shadows forming under her chin, along the folds of the hoodie and beneath the shelves. The entire aisle from her body to the far end stays mostly in sharp focus. Mild digital noise shows in the darker gaps between the boxes and under the shelves, several flyaway hairs cross the frame, the photo tilts a few degrees to the right, one lower corner is slightly soft, and the bottom edge cuts off unevenly across her upper thighs."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"l4cie, a casual front-camera snap taken on an iPhone in a supermarket aisle, the phone held a bit too close and slightly below her chin so her face and upper body fill most of the frame with noticeable wide-angle distortion at the edges and a clear tilt to the right. She stands between two tall shelves of cereal boxes, weight shifted onto her left leg with her right hip cocked slightly outward, right shoulder leaning lightly against the edge of the shelf while her left hand holds a box of cereal she just pulled off the shelf, fingers wrapped around the bottom. She wears an oversized grey zip-up hoodie left half open over a plain white tank top, the hoodie fabric bunching at the elbows and hanging loosely over her torso, paired with loose dark blue sweatpants that sit low on